---
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/config';
import { absoluteUrl, pageTitle } from '@/lib/seo';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle('Privacy')}
  description="Privacy notice for tristanvisser.co.za."
  canonical={absoluteUrl('/privacy/')}
  noindex
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Privacy."
    intro="This is a personal portfolio, not a business. It collects as little as possible. Here is what that means in practice."
  />

  <section class="py-section">
    <div class="page-width max-w-[68ch]">
      <div class="space-y-10 text-small leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Who is responsible</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This site is run by {site.name}, based in {site.location}. You can reach me at{' '}
            <a class="link-inline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
              {site.email}
            </a>
            .
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">What I collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If you use the contact form, I receive the name, email address and message you submit.
            That information is used only to reply to you. I do not add you to a mailing list or use
            it for marketing.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process technical request data such as
            your IP address and browser information to deliver the site, protect it from abuse and
            keep it available. I do not use that data to identify individual visitors.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not collect
            personal information for advertising. The contact form also uses Cloudflare Turnstile to
            distinguish people from bots. Turnstile may process browser signals to verify a
            submission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Why I collect it</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To reply to your message, to keep the site secure and available, and to understand at a
            high level whether the site is being visited. I do not sell personal information or
            share it for advertising.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">How long I keep it</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Contact messages stay in my email inbox until the conversation is finished, and are
            deleted when they are no longer needed. Cloudflare's own retention periods apply to
            technical logs. I do not keep a separate database of contact form submissions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You can ask me what personal information I hold about you, ask me to correct or delete
            it, or object to how it is processed. Email{' '}
            <a class="link-inline" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
              {site.email}
            </a>{' '}
            and I will respond. If you are not satisfied, you can contact the South African
            Information Regulator at{' '}
            <a
              class="link-inline"
              href="https://inforegulator.org.za"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              inforegulator.org.za
            </a>
            .
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Cookies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This site does not use advertising or tracking cookies. Cloudflare may set strictly
            necessary cookies for security and bot protection. There is no cookie banner because
            there is nothing optional to consent to. Your light or dark theme preference is stored
            locally in your browser and is not sent to me.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">Changes</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If the site starts collecting different information, this notice will be updated. The
            date below is the last meaningful change.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted">
            Last updated: October 2026
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
